{
  "name": "Matrix",
  "kind": "interface",
  "brief": "A 3x3 transformation matrix for 2D transformations.",
  "description": [
    "The matrix elements represent: - e11, e12: Rotation/scale in X - e21, e22: Rotation/scale in Y - e13, e23: Translation in X and Y - e31, e32: Always 0 (reserved for 3D) - e33: Always 1 (homogeneous coordinate)",
    "Matrix layout: ``` | e11  e12  e13 | | e21  e22  e23 | | e31  e32  e33 | ```"
